Checks GitHub for a newer release, asks, then downloads it, verifies its checksum and replaces this binary.

Usage:
  portly update [flags]

Examples:
  portly update             check, ask, then update
  portly update --yes       do not ask
  portly update --json      check only, change nothing

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for update
  -y, --yes    do not ask

Global Flags:
      --json      print one JSON document
      --verbose   print diagnostics on stderr
